Modifications in manifoldalign:
  - the OpenMP header and runtime calls are guarded by #ifdef _OPENMP, with
    single-threaded fallbacks, so the code compiles without OpenMP;
  - the number of OpenMP threads is an explicit setting (numThreads(),
    default 1) instead of omp_get_max_threads().
